[1.556234, "o", "\u001b[36msession/new\u001b[0m → ccbfdf60-f0ac-49a2-8ba7-e4d7ac97e45b \u001b[2m(workspace /tmp/calc-98plp0ac)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36myou ›\u001b[0m Read calc.py and test_calc.py in my workspace and tell me in two sentences why the test fails. Don't change anything yet.\r\n\u001b[1mviktor ›\u001b[0m "]
